'''''Psidium longipetiolatum''''' or '''araca vermelho''' is a species of [[plant]] in the family [[Myrtaceae]]. It is found growing on the hillsides of the [[Atlantic Forest]] in the states of [[Paraná (state)|Paraná]] and [[Santa Catarina, Brazil]].<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.tropicos.org/Name/22105313|title= Psidium longipetiolatum in Tropicos}}</ref> It grows 4–6 meters tall and up to 30 meters in cultivation. Plants fruit from January to March.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.colecionandofrutas.org/psidiumlongipetiolatum.htm|title= PSIDIUM LONGIPETIOLATUM FAMILIA DAS MYRTACEAS}}</ref>

